	(text "Slot 1: R1, radio port card.\nRF positions 1 to 6 = ANT1 to ANT6 (all antenna lines).\nSLOT_ID3..0 = 0001: a 0 bit is strapped to GND, a 1 bit is open (pull-up on the card).\nPins b20 to b32 and all other unlabelled contacts: see pin-out on the root sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
